invariant: INV-14
file: srv_flight.c
catches: srv_flight_test_aes
reason: srv_check_retry_hello takes a second ClientHello only when the
  cookie names ChaCha20, the check the first SUITE=aesgcm server carried
  beside the cookie's own. The cookie opens, and the retry still fails
  with illegal_parameter for a client that offers AES-GCM alone.
  test_flight_retry_suite runs that retry to the end.

--- old
    if (group != CH_KEX_GROUP) {
--- new
    if (suite != SUITE_CHACHA20_POLY1305_SHA256 || group != CH_KEX_GROUP) {
